"""Typed access to the twin {{ json.dumps(twin_name) }} ({{ twin_id }}) over its HTTP API.

Generated by the twin's toolkit from its ontology and from the OpenAPI document
its API serves; generate it again rather than editing it.

`Twin()` reads the API's address from `{{ base_url_env }}` and its token from
`{{ token_env }}`. Neither is written anywhere, logged or shown.
"""

